WEBVTT

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:32.960
which means having the capability
to rectify its own faults and problems.

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:34.930
And, most importantly,

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:39.570
female scientists worked shoulder 
to shoulder along with male scientists

00:06:39.570 --> 00:06:41.650
to make this mission a success.

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:44.650
(Applause)

00:06:45.140 --> 00:06:47.260
The whole country was watching us,

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:50.460
and it suddenly hit me that, 
our aspirations,

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:56.140
our expectations paled in comparison
to the hopes of the country.

00:06:56.750 --> 00:07:01.810
And we saw the country’s hope
being fulfilled right in front of us.